{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEMO FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1 main character</strong> (the demon king) and <strong>1 support character</strong> (wife). The full release will have <strong>4 main characters</strong> and <strong>4 support characters</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1st world only</strong>. The full release will contains the <strong>2nd world</strong> as well as the <strong>hidden stage/final boss</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Default difficulty</strong>. The full release will have <strong>multiple ascension difficulty levels</strong>, with more  mechanics and enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bonus stage (demo exclusive)</strong>: trying to damage the <strong>RnGesus</strong> as much as possible and <strong>collect highscore</strong> based on the <strong>total damage deal</strong>. This acts as both a <strong>highscore mode</strong> for <strong>replayability</strong> as well as a way to gauge <strong>how strong your builds is</strong> after completing the demo.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ABOUT THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RnGesus Slayer: It's Slay the Spire meets slot machine! <br><br><strong>RnGesus Slayer</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilder where you have <strong>3 separate decks</strong> and cards are dealt by <strong>spinning a slot machine</strong>! <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031290/extras/1.gif?t=1742476072\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cards with <strong>similar type</strong> when land will <strong>combo</strong> together to create an <strong>upgraded version</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031290/extras/2.gif?t=1742476072\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use <strong>weapons cards</strong> to attack the minions of the godess, <strong>magic cards</strong> to gain mana to use spells, and<strong> gold cards</strong> to buy upgrades to your decks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031290/extras/3.gif?t=1742476072\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tons of <strong>unique spells</strong> to kill the enemies, upgrade your hands/decks or rig the slot-machine to your advantage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031290/extras/4.gif?t=1742476072\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique spell and power system, with over 35+ spells, 15+ powers and 45+ enemies to fight</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031290/extras/5.gif?t=1742476072\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the <strong>Free demo</strong> now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031290/extras/6.gif?t=1742476072\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3031290?t=1742476072","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3031290?t=1742476072","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031290/45cfc9c0257c9f17e034d664888d21f49225baec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742476072","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031290/45cfc9c0257c9f17e034d664888d21f49225baec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742476072","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEMO FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1 main character</strong> (the demon king) and <strong>1 support character</strong> (wife). The full release will have <strong>4 main characters</strong> and <strong>4 support characters</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1st world only</strong>. The full release will contains the <strong>2nd world</strong> as well as the <strong>hidden stage/final boss</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Default difficulty</strong>. The full release will have <strong>multiple ascension difficulty levels</strong>, with more  mechanics and enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bonus stage (demo exclusive)</strong>: trying to damage the <strong>RnGesus</strong> as much as possible and <strong>collect highscore</strong> based on the <strong>total damage deal</strong>. This acts as both a <strong>highscore mode</strong> for <strong>replayability</strong> as well as a way to gauge <strong>how strong your builds is</strong> after completing the demo.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ABOUT THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RnGesus Slayer: It's Slay the Spire meets slot machine! <br><br><strong>RnGesus Slayer</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilder where you have <strong>3 separate decks</strong> and cards are dealt by <strong>spinning a slot machine</strong>! <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031290/extras/1.gif?t=1742476072\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cards with <strong>similar type</strong> when land will <strong>combo</strong> together to create an <strong>upgraded version</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031290/extras/2.gif?t=1742476072\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use <strong>weapons cards</strong> to attack the minions of the godess, <strong>magic cards</strong> to gain mana to use spells, and<strong> gold cards</strong> to buy upgrades to your decks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031290/extras/3.gif?t=1742476072\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tons of <strong>unique spells</strong> to kill the enemies, upgrade your hands/decks or rig the slot-machine to your advantage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031290/extras/4.gif?t=1742476072\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique spell and power system, with over 35+ spells, 15+ powers and 45+ enemies to fight</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031290/extras/5.gif?t=1742476072\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the <strong>Free demo</strong> now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031290/extras/6.gif?t=1742476072\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Lemon Chihuahua"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3007890","name":"RnGesus Slayer"},"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3031290/22bd0581dd582f941c80d2c58d39894f7c2481e8/header.jpg?t=1742476072","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257112433,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112433/movie480.mp4?t=1741937151","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112433/movie_max.mp4?t=1741937151"},"name":"Trailer-3-Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257112433/3d581d7a1dc9e87389df77d2ece9e7071b056e6c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741937151","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2